  "title": "Google Introduces Gemini AI for Car Integration and Navigation",
  "summary": "Google introduces a personalized Gemini AI assistant for cars, allowing it to access Google services like Gmail, Calendar, Maps, and Photos to provide tailored responses while driving. The app is also available in navigation through Apple CarPlay for US drivers, with global rollout planned.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Google introduces a more personalized version of its Gemini AI assistant for cars, allowing access to Google services like Gmail, Calendar, Maps, and Photos for driving.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Google plans to bring the Gemini AI for navigation to Apple CarPlay users globally, with a rollout happening in the US.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The new Gemini navigation feature is available today for US drivers, with global rollout expected.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
